        "task": "Write backend/src/routes.ts from scratch. Implement every endpoint from api_contract with real handler bodies per business_logic_contract. Keep route paths, HTTP methods, and request/response field names byte-identical to the contract. Data: pg Pool from env (DATABASE_HOST/PORT/NAME/USER/PASSWORD). Auth: x-amzn-oidc-data JWT sub/email for user identity. Auto-create user row on first login if not exists. Filter all task queries by user_id. Validate title is non-empty string on POST/PUT. Return 404 if task not found or not owned by user. Pagination: limit/offset with default limit=50, newest first.",
